March 8, 2021

Background:

The item for consideration is a Zoning Map Amendment. This is approved by Ordinance.

The proposed Governing Body review schedule is as follows:
•
Introduction and Referral
3/8/2021
•
Public Services Committee
3/16/2021
•
Second Reading

3/22/2021
•
