### Page 7 of 17

```text
UDC-21-00046

March 1, 2021
8) Whether the application will harm the public health, safety, or general welfare. (UDC
2.2.1.d.8)

City staff is satisfied that this proposed zone change would not adversely affect the public
health, safety, or general welfare.

The proposed zone change for the subject property from County MR to MR complies with
review criteria 8.

CONFORMANCE WITH APPLICABLE PLANS:

The project is located in an area covered by the following plans:
•
PlanCheyenne
The application conforms to PlanCheyenne per the discussion with Review Criterion 1.

STAFF REVIEW:

The application is consistent with the surrounding MR Zone. As noted before, the property is
being annexed to serve as access to the Mission Village senior housing development. The MR
zone is consistent with the surrounding property and the annexation will remove a County
enclave. Staff is supportive of the zoning map amendment.

CONCLUSION:

Staff is satisfied that the application meets the review criteria set forth in UDC 2.2.1.(d) The
application facilitates access to a proposed development, is complimentary to the surrounding
neighborhood, and is compatible with the existing MR zone district to the north, south, and
west. The zone change meets the review criteria of UDC 2.2.1.(d); therefore, staff recommends
approval of the zoning map amendment as submitted by the applicant.

ALTERNATIVES:

1. Recommend approval of the zoning amendment as submitted by the applicant (Staff
Recommendation).
2. Recommend approval of the zoning amendment subject to conditions or modifications.
3. Recommend denial of the zoning amendment based on findings of denial. The Planning
Commission must conclude that the project does not meet all the review criteria. As part of the
motion, findings for denial must be stated.
4. Postpone the zoning amendment until issues identified during the meeting can be resolved.

General Information Regarding Alternatives:

In the event that the Commission acts contrary to staff’s recommendation or modifies conditions of approval,
the Commission shall cite specific reasons (based on the review criteria) for approval or denial.
```

